# CNI Plugin & Pod Network Sandbox Diagnostics Guide

Network plugins (such as Cilium, Calico, or Flannel) configure pod network namespaces via files located in
`/etc/cni/net.d/` and binary executables in `/opt/cni/bin/`.

---

